[#{{ number }}] We received your request: {{ subject }}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:12px;color:#616e7c;">{{ reply_marker }}</p>
<p>Hi {{ requester }},</p>
<p>We received your request and will reply as soon as possible. Its number is <strong>{{ number }}</strong> and {{ department }} is handling it.</p>
<p>To add anything, just reply to this email.{% if has_account and portal_url %} You can also follow it from <a href="{{ portal_url }}/soporte/{{ ticket_id }}">your account</a>.{% endif %}</p>
<div style="margin:16px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:#f4f5f7;border-radius:6px;white-space:pre-wrap;">{{ message }}</div>
{% if files.size > 0 %}<p>Attachments: {{ files | join: ", " }}</p>{% endif %}
